OL,3,GNEWSAFamily avoid disaster in air con
OL,4,Aexplosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has told how they were seconds
OL,7,Ffrom disaster after their portable air
OL,8,Fconditioning unit caught fire and
OL,9,Fexploded.
OL,11,FGregory Lawless woke up at home in
OL,12,FMilton Keynes at about 02:50 BST to
OL,13,Ffind the unit on fire in the upstairs
OL,14,Fhallway.
OL,16,FHe unplugged it and dragged it
OL,17,Fdownstairs, away from his sleeping wife
OL,18,Fand 10-year-old son, before taking it
OL,19,Foutside on to the drive, where the
OL,20,Fcompressor exploded.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
